#: templates/admin_menu_help.php:264
msgid ""
"The option \"w\" is optional with which you can specify the width of the "
"video in the form of \"%\" or \"px\". By default, a width of \"100%\" is set "
"if the option \"w\" is not specified."
msgstr ""
